-- Launch content (owner approved launch, 3 Nov 2026). Production database only; staging and tests are untouched.
-- Fills the legal pages and tutoring link only where still empty, removes the unverified student-count claim,
-- and publishes the Student Agreement once. Admin -> Site settings can change any of these afterwards.
